id: half-saiyan
name: Half-Saiyan
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Traits and never enforced (the user's). Its Factor Traits are
# the files in the folder of its name.
requirement: Saiyan
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Through the combination of two races’ potential, your own soars to even greater heights. Thanks to having a Saiyan and a non-Saiyan parent, you possess all the combat potential of the Saiyans, enhanced by your other parent’s potential for growth.
